{"title":"시한부 드래곤의 생존법","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=e7Sko/hAC1LIYhfi/pihE7GyEeaOR4WY00kkUZK&filename=th3","synopsis":"시한부 인생 끝에 웹툰 속 드래곤으로 빙의했는데\n또 다시 시한부 인생, 아니 용생이 되었다?!\n\n갑부에다 수천년의 수명을 가진 세계관 최강의 생물\n드래곤의 헤츨링으로 태어난 로이스.\n\n하지만 시시각각 닥쳐오는 개연성 없는 위기에\n언제 죽을 지 모른다니 이게 무슨 소리야!\n\n이대로 얌전히 죽기엔 너무 억울하다.\n알고 있는 미래를 이용해 악착같이 살아남아서\n이 작품에 깽판을 쳐줄 테다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":271,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":266,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":205,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":278,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":266,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":252,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":274,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":218,"change":{"type":"up","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":284,"change":{"type":"down","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":260,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":275,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":292,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-09-24","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank"